Choose equipment by testing the NAHPU workflow you will actually use. NAHPU is designed to work on mobile and desktop devices. Start with the [Installation guide](/en/installation/) for platform-specific installation instructions. Below is a list of the devices we have used in field expeditions, along with the number of days and specimens recorded. Use this as a reference to compare your own field season's expected workload.

## Devices used in field expeditions

